---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="AI Grant Toolkit — Base Impact"
  description="An AI-assisted grant-writing toolkit for micro-nonprofits: draft proposals, budgets, and narratives locally and privately. Built by Base Impact for Brevard, Volusia, and Orange counties, Florida."
>
  <section class="py-vh-3">
    <div class="max-w-3xl">
      <p class="eyebrow">Program · Grants &amp; Funding</p>
      <h1 class="display-4 mt-3">Grant writing help, powered by local AI.</h1>
      <p class="section-lead">
        Most small nonprofits cannot afford a grant writer — and most grants go to organizations
        that can tell their story on paper. The AI Grant Toolkit helps a one-to-five person group
        produce a clear, complete proposal without hiring anyone.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-2 md:items-start">
    <figure class="lp-card-media" data-reveal="fade-right">
      <img src="/assets/baseimpact-coc-membership-2026-10-29.jpg" alt="Base Impact community meeting in Brevard County" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="800" height="520" />
    </figure>
    <div class="lp-card" data-reveal="fade-left">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold" style="color: var(--color-body);">The problem we keep hitting</h2>
      <p class="text-muted leading-relaxed mt-3">
        We hear the same thing from pantries, churches, and outreach groups across Brevard County:
        they know what they do, but writing a proposal, a budget, and an outcomes plan stops them
        cold. Meanwhile the foundations that could fund them ask for exactly those documents.
      </p>
      <p class="text-sm text-faint mt-4">Grant-writing capacity is one of the gaps our community analysis identified — there is no local service that fills it.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-vh-3">
    <div class="max-w-4xl">
      <h2 class="section-title mb-4">What the toolkit does</h2>
      <div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
        <div class="lp-card">
          <h3 class="font-display text-base font-semibold" style="color: var(--color-body);">Guided intake</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted mt-1">A plain-language questionnaire turns “what we do” into structured answers a proposal needs.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="lp-card">
          <h3 class="font-display text-base font-semibold" style="color: var(--color-body);">Template library</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted mt-1">Narrative sections, logic models, and evaluation plans mapped to common funder priorities.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="lp-card">
          <h3 class="font-display text-base font-semibold" style="color: var(--color-body);">Budget builder</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted mt-1">Line-item budget templates with the math done for you, ready for attachments.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="lp-card">
          <h3 class="font-display text-base font-semibold" style="color: var(--color-body);">Plain-language editing</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted mt-1">AI review that tightens prose, cuts jargon, and flags missing pieces before you submit.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="lp-card">
          <h3 class="font-display text-base font-semibold" style="color: var(--color-body);">Export &amp; package</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted mt-1">One-click export to DOCX/PDF so nothing has to be retyped into a funder portal.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="lp-card">
          <h3 class="font-display text-base font-semibold" style="color: var(--color-body);">Local-first privacy</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted mt-1">Models run on the organization's own machine where possible — sensitive client and financial data never leaves the device.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="text-xs text-faint mt-4">These are the planned capabilities. We publish features as they are built and tested, not before.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-2 md:items-start">
    <div class="lp-card" data-reveal="fade-right">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold" style="color: var(--color-body);">Who it serves</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-5 text-muted mt-3 space-y-1">
        <li>Churches, pantries, and 1–5 person community organizations in Brevard, Volusia, and Orange counties</li>
        <li>Groups applying for their first grant or reapplying after a rejection</li>
        <li>Volunteer-run organizations with no staff time to spare</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="text-sm text-faint mt-4">Base Impact uses the same discipline internally for its own funding applications.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="lp-card" data-reveal="fade-left">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold" style="color: var(--color-body);">Why local AI</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-5 text-muted mt-3 space-y-1">
        <li>Privacy — no cloud dependency, no donor or client data uploaded</li>
        <li>Access — works offline and on older hardware</li>
        <li>Cost — free for small nonprofits, funded through grants and sponsorships</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-vh-3">
    <div class="rounded-5 gradient p-8 sm:p-10 text-center">
      <h2 class="display-4" style="color:#fff;">Interested in the pilot?</h2>
      <p class="section-lead mx-auto" style="text-align:center; color:rgba(255,255,255,.85);">
        We're building this toolkit in the open. Small nonprofits that join the pilot get early access
        and direct input on what gets built next.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3">
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-light">Join the pilot waitlist</a>
        <a href="/grants" class="btn btn-outline-light">Grants &amp; funding</a>
      </div>
      <p class="text-xs mt-4" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,.7);">No cost to participate. No obligation. Just tell us what you need.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
